    {A3 : FamIn3 D.what₂.LL G Pl0 I0 (List ℕ) T0 D.R.m} {C : CoreJ D} [Algebra C.Q.c.F D.what₂.LL] (R : RealDat3 D A3 C.Q.c.F)
